---
title: "initializePublishSaleResults (LegionSealedBidAuctionSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: check caller is Legion operator
    q_check_auth --> q_check_stage: authorized
    q_check_auth --> q_revert: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_stage --> q_check_not_locked: refund period ended
    q_check_stage --> q_revert: revert InvalidStage
    q_check_not_locked --> q_lock: cancelLocked == false
    q_check_not_locked --> q_revert: revert AlreadyLocked
    q_lock --> [*]: cancelLocked = true, emit CancellationLocked
    q_revert --> [*]: revert with error

    note right of q_lock
        INV-001: once cancelLocked is true, cancel() is permanently disabled
        INV-002: initialization is prerequisite for publishSaleResults
        INV-003: can only be called after refund period ends
    end note
